    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about needing a nap or some rest though. i mean, even if i take a break, the debt is still there, the mistakes i made at work are still there... it doesn't go away. it's like no matter how much i \"rest,\" the treadmill just keeps picking up speed. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop of failing over and over and it's not even worth the energy to try and fix it anymore.",
