      "content": "stopping the fight... i don't even know what that would look like. it just feels like there's no way out that doesn't involve just... letting it all end. like eventually, you just have to accept that the only real way to stop the noise and the pressure is to just stop existing entirely. it feels so much more peaceful to think about than trying to keep going.",
